 "teaches": [
  "The whole screen is one DashboardGrid call: seven cards in reading order, the energy chart with span 2 and the weather with priority 2 (hidden on a phone)",
  "A card's content gets an exact box; RowList embedded takes \"@cardWidth\" and \"@cardHeight\", so the lights list with switches fits whatever card the width makes",
  "KPI cards are BigNumber over a Sparkline capped at min(@cardHeight - 80, 64) dp: rows grow to fill a tablet, the number stays at the top and the line stays calm",
  "Switches bind exported document variables (@liv, @kit...), so the host reads and drives each room"
 ],
